{"duration_api_ms":55453,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6cf51a1d-594f-4a90-b105-fcff9f6463e5","total_cost_usd":0.5762278,"usage":{"input_tokens":30,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46319,"cache_read_input_tokens":594779,"output_tokens":4330,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":908},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46319,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":580,"cache_read_input_tokens":51453,"cache_creation_input_tokens":846,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":846},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":30,"outputTokens":4330,"cacheReadInputTokens":594779,"cacheCreationInputTokens":46319,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5762278,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":908,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_014RXRuPr4oBAQWkbDfZ3dYZ","tool_input":{"command":"cd /Users/christoph/Privat/samples/wp68-dotnet; grep -n \"E2E\\|e2e\\|skipp\" tasks/product-slider/tests.md tasks/product-slider/build.md | head -20; tail -5 tasks/product-slider/.verify/journal.tsv; curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" http://localhost:5080/products; echo \"E2E=$E2E_BASE_URL\""}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01F6Cvp28uCHFZUnNkw4AZf4","tool_input":{"command":"cd /Users/christoph/Privat/samples/wp68-dotnet; grep -n \"E2E\\|e2e\\|skipp\" tasks/product-slider/tests.md tasks/product-slider/build.md | head -20; curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" http://localhost:5080/products; env | grep E2E"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01JGVHVPyChjRar5K5nmvPFP","tool_input":{"command":"for i in $(seq 1 60); do curl -sf -o /dev/null http://localhost:5080/products && break; sleep 2; done; E2E_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5080 dotnet test tests/DcaShop.E2eTests --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~ProductPageE2eTest\" 2>&1 | tail -15","timeout":300000}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_016B3Asmu774UHSdfK12VSb4","tool_input":{"command":"E2E_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5080 dotnet test tests/DcaShop.E2eTests --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~ProductPageE2eTest\" 2>&1 | tail -8","timeout":300000}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_015Xr3aTPjMbpoZnaYRTpPAe","tool_input":{"command":"E2E_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5080 dotnet test /Users/christoph/Privat/samples/wp68-dotnet/tests/DcaShop.E2eTests --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~ProductPageE2eTest\"","timeout":300000}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":18,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The gate's one failure isn't fixed yet. It isn't a bug in the test, and I couldn't clear it from this session.\n\n**Why it failed:** the gate ran `ProductPageE2eTest#ViewDetailsOnACatalogueCardOpensThatProductsPage` without `E2E_BASE_URL`. Every `[E2eFact]` test in `DcaShop.E2eTests` skips when that variable isn't set, and the gate reports a skipped test as a failure. The four integration tests already passed.\n\n**What I did:**\n- I left the test as it is. Making it run without a running shop would change the suite's runner setup, which the test stage isn't allowed to touch.\n- I started the shop in the background on port 5080, and it's still running. I didn't manage to run the browser test against it: every command that sets `E2E_BASE_URL` needed an approval that wasn't given. So the test has still not been seen passing, and its break patch hasn't been tried either.\n- I added a note to `tasks/CAT-02/tests.md` explaining the skip and how the gate has to be run.\n\n**What passes it:** re-run the gate the way `product-slider` did, with the shop running:\n```\nE2E_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5080 python3 .agents/factory/story-gate.py --story CAT-02 --stage test\n```\nAlternatively, approve `E2E_BASE_URL=… dotnet test tests/DcaShop.E2eTests` in this session and I'll run the test myself. Either way the break still isn't covered: it is applied to a scratch copy, while the browser test runs against the shop at `E2E_BASE_URL`. `tests.md` already notes this.","ttft_ms":2574,"type":"result","duration_ms":55980,"uuid":"ad3d3afc-ef61-4be8-97f2-2a40dcb9a281","ttft_stream_ms":2016,"time_to_request_ms":103,"first_content_frame_ms":2016,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
